{"name": "VANRAN", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras_big/e9dc99831a748749d9afe9d4951f3ef2.webp?t=1781729091\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/e9dc99831a748749d9afe9d4951f3ef2.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/bd35344d84700b8a15a0ea2d63237a72.poster.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/bd35344d84700b8a15a0ea2d63237a72.webm?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/bd35344d84700b8a15a0ea2d63237a72.mp4?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For a hundred years, Caleb stood as the shield of the Northern Frontier. He watched hundreds of souls vanish into the abyss, thrown by the very royalty he swore to protect.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His rebellion was met with steel. Past brothers-in-arms became his executioners. And to escape their blades, he chose the fall.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it\u2019s time to show them what an angered soul can do when he has nothing left to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras_big/7f9947495e5e729a004514f0827a25bc.webp?t=1781729091\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/7f9947495e5e729a004514f0827a25bc.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VANRAN is a dark fantasy action RPG where a fallen human slave wields a sealed blade to spark rebellion. To survive the horrors of the Demon Realm, players must master the use of movement and steel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/deae11a118728fb635396be9ab834647.poster.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/deae11a118728fb635396be9ab834647.webm?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/deae11a118728fb635396be9ab834647.mp4?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the trap-ridden dungeons of VANRAN, navigating ancient planes of the Demon Realm, where every step requires a strong intent and unbreakable will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/8b163653960f2be19219469b177d8fdf.poster.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/8b163653960f2be19219469b177d8fdf.webm?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/8b163653960f2be19219469b177d8fdf.mp4?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a combat system where you can utilize the art of active parry to catch and return the momentum of your opponent\u2019s strike, all while weaving in and out of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras_big/0c9d9fac7f119a65ecef7616fbce324b.webp?t=1781729091\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/0c9d9fac7f119a65ecef7616fbce324b.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to face and scale the gigantic monuments of the Demon Realm known as the Govu. These encounters are not mere bosses but are multi-stage fights, offering vertical play that demands every ounce of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/26ad7d108cc5e73baeb9788e5e58dc9c.poster.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/26ad7d108cc5e73baeb9788e5e58dc9c.webm?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/26ad7d108cc5e73baeb9788e5e58dc9c.mp4?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because in VANRAN, in order to kill a God, you must learn to climb one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras_big/2d1ecfa46bc407927d51595bcdb53c08.webp?t=1781729091\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/2d1ecfa46bc407927d51595bcdb53c08.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Every soul reaped, and every Lord killed brings you closer to the final chapter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices throughout the rebellion will echo in the Demon Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/3ea747aa0b64811dc308455f63a05667.poster.avif?t=1781729091\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/3ea747aa0b64811dc308455f63a05667.webm?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/3ea747aa0b64811dc308455f63a05667.mp4?t=1781729091\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story does not end with victory, it ends with the legacy you leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Which ending will you come to?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "VANRAN is a dark fantasy action RPG where a human slave in the Demon Realm wields a sealed blade and rises in rebellion. Defeat your enemies, claim their powers, grow stronger, and escape. Seek salvation\u2014or choose vengeance.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/f15a6569be0ceaab8887b5c861240d1f3c0984be/header.jpg?t=1781729091", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Souls-like", "Dark Fantasy", "Third Person", "Singleplayer", "Action"], "developers": "BECUZUS", "publishers": "BECUZUS", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3449370", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "23 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Qvd7uVAiYeM", "first_seen": 1769122800.0, "review_rank": 1353}